<title>SOUTH KOREA: TABLE-Korea First Bank H1 loss widens.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Korea First Bank H1 loss widens.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30</p>
<p>(In billions of won unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (won, both loss)	     2,175     vs  211</p>
<p>    Net (both loss)			356.49  vs   34.61</p>
<p>    Profit before tax (both loss)    354.39  vs   32.41</p>
<p>    Revenue				1,274.44  vs 1,176.90</p>
<p>NOTE - The Korea First Bank is one of South Korea's leading commerical banks. The bank was hit hard by a chain of corporate defaults early this year. The figures were released by the Korea Listed Companies Association.</p>
<p>--Seoul Newsroom (822) 727-5648</p>
</text>
